{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06411","headline":"绝缨歌 · 李颀","name":"绝缨歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚王宴客章华台，章华美人善歌舞。\n玉颜艳艳空相向，满堂目成不得语。\n红烛灭，芳酒阑，罗衣半醉春夜寒。\n绝缨解带一爲欢，君王赦过不之罪。\n暗中珠翠鸣珊珊，宁爱贤，不爱色。\n青娥买死谁能识，果却一军全社稷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}